{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27447","headline":"捉搦歌 · 张祜","name":"捉搦歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门上关，墙上棘。\n窗中女子声唧唧，洛阳大道徒自直。\n女子心在婆舍侧，呜呜笼鸟触四隅。\n养男男娶妇，养女女嫁夫。\n阿婆六十翁七十，不知女子长日泣，从他嫁去无悒悒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27447.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27447","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}